: \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1021\", \"snippet\": \"Gram & Mol amounts are per Liter of medium.\"}, {\"old_field\": \"ingredients[11].concentration\", \"field\": \"ingredients[8].concentration\", \"old\": {\"value\": \"2.8\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"new\": {\"value\": \"0.22\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"status\": \"correct\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1021\", \"snippet\": \"NaH2PO4 x 2 H2O NaH2PO4 SEED-cpd00009#cpd00971## 0.22 0.00\"}, {\"old_field\": \"ingredients[11].notes\", \"field\": \"ingredients[8].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"The KOMODO table explicitly reports Gram Amount per liter of medium. Retain the exact source precision at medium scope, not the previously copied DSMZ stock rate. The separate rounded Mol Amount column is not used for conversion.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1021\", \"snippet\": \"NaH2PO4 x 2 H2O NaH2PO4 SEED-cpd00009#cpd00971## 0.22 0.00\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"ingredients[8].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"The KOMODO table explicitly reports Gram Amount per liter of medium. Retain the exact source precision at medium scope, not the previously copied DSMZ stock rate. The separate rounded Mol Amount column is not used for conversion.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1021\", \"snippet\": \"Gram & Mol amounts are per Liter of medium.\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"ingredients[9].concentration\", \"old\": null, \"new\": {\"value\": \"6.48\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"status\": \"add\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1021\", \"snippet\": \"casein hydrolysate casein hydrolysate rich-peptone# 6.48 null\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"ingredients[9].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"The KOMODO table explicitly reports Gram Amount per liter of medium. Retain the exact source precision at medium scope, not the previously copied DSMZ stock rate. The separate rounded Mol Amount column is not used for conversion.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1021\", \"snippet\": \"casein hydrolysate casein hydrolysate rich-peptone# 6.48 null\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"ingredients[9].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"The KOMODO table explicitly reports Gram Amount per liter of medium. Retain the exact source precision at medium scope, not the previously copied DSMZ stock rate. The separate rounded Mol Amount column is not used for conversion.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1021\", \"snippet\": \"Gram & Mol amounts are per Liter of medium.\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"ingredients[10].concentration\", \"old\": null, \"new\": null, \"status\": \"not_quantified\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1021\", \"snippet\": \"Distilled water H2O SEED-cpd00001### null null\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"ingredients[10].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"The source lists this component with null Gram and Mol amounts. Its amount is unknown, not zero; no gas fraction, flow rate or fixed water dose is inferred.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1021\", \"snippet\": \"Distilled water H2O SEED-cpd00001### null null\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"ingredients[10].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"The source lists this component with null Gram and Mol amounts. Its amount is unknown, not zero; no gas fraction, flow rate or fixed water dose is inferred.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1021\", \"snippet\": \"Gram & Mol amounts are per Liter of medium.\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"ingredients[11].concentration\", \"old\": null, \"new\": null, \"status\": \"not_quantified\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1021\", \"snippet\": \"new borne calf serum new borne calf serum rich-serum# 200.00 0.20\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"ingredients[11].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"The table's generic Gram/Mol columns show 200.00 and 0.20 for serum; these do not establish density or a chemically meaningful molarity. No numeric concentration is adopted. The linked recipe supplies a 4:1 base/serum preparation ratio.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1021\", \"snippet\": \"new borne calf serum new borne calf serum rich-serum# 200.00 0.20\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"ingredients[11].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"The table's generic Gram/Mol columns show 200.00 and 0.20 for serum; these do not establish density or a chemically meaningful molarity. No numeric concentration is adopted. The linked recipe supplies a 4:1 base/serum preparation ratio.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1021\", \"snippet\": \"Gram & Mol amounts are per Liter of medium.\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"preparation_steps[0].description\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"Prepare Solution A according to the linked DSMZ 1021 protocol and adjust Solution A to pH 8.0. This is not a measured final-medium pH.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium1021.pdf\", \"snippet\": \"Adjust pH to 8.0.\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"preparation_steps[1].description\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"For the solid preparation, sterilize Solution A and Solution B separately at 121 C for 20 min. Do not autoclave the serum-supplemented mixture.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium1021.pdf\", \"snippet\": \"Sterilize solution A and B separately at 121\\uf0b0C for 20 min. Cool to 50\\uf0b0C, then combine. To\\n4 parts of the above, add 1 part sterile foetal or new borne calf serum. Liquid medium\\nshould be filter sterilized instead of autoclaved.\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"preparation_steps[2].description\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"Cool the separately sterilized solutions to 50 C, then combine A and B.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium1021.pdf\", \"snippet\": \"Sterilize solution A and B separately at 121\\uf0b0C for 20 min. Cool to 50\\uf0b0C, then combine. To\\n4 parts of the above, add 1 part sterile foetal or new borne calf serum. Liquid medium\\nshould be filter sterilized instead of autoclaved.\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"preparation_steps[3].description\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"To 4 parts of the combined basal preparation, add 1 part sterile foetal or newborn calf serum. Preserve the reported ratio; no fixed serum batch dose or mass concentration is asserted.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium1021.pdf\", \"snippet\": \"Sterilize solution A and B separately at 121\\uf0b0C for 20 min. Cool to 50\\uf0b0C, then combine. To\\n4 parts of the above, add 1 part sterile foetal or new borne calf serum. Liquid medium\\nshould be filter sterilized instead of autoclaved.\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"variants[0].modifications\", \"old\": null, \"new\": [\"Filter sterilize the liquid preparation instead of autoclaving. No membrane pore size is specified.\", \"The source does not explicitly quantify the agar change for this alternative; no numeric agar amount is invented.\"], \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium1021.pdf\", \"snippet\": \"Sterilize solution A and B separately at 121\\uf0b0C for 20 min. Cool to 50\\uf0b0C, then combine. To\\n4 parts of the above, add 1 part sterile foetal or new borne calf serum. Liquid medium\\nshould be filter sterilized instead of autoclaved.\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"ingredients[11].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"The table's generic Gram/Mol columns show 200.00 and 0.20 for serum; these do not establish density or a chemically meaningful molarity. No numeric concentration is adopted. The linked recipe supplies a 4:1 base/serum preparation ratio.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium1021.pdf\", \"snippet\": \"Sterilize solution A and B separately at 121\\uf0b0C for 20 min. Cool to 50\\uf0b0C, then combine. To\\n4 parts of the above, add 1 part sterile foetal or new borne calf serum. Liquid medium\\nshould be filter sterilized instead of autoclaved.\"}, {\"old_field\": \"ph_value\", \"field\": \"ph_value\", \"old\": 8.0, \"new\": 8.0, \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=1021\", \"snippet\": \"PH Info: 8.0\"}, {\"old_field\": \"ingredients[1].concentration\", \"field\": \"notes\", \"old\": {\"value\": \"10.0\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"new\": \"Source: KOMODO ModelSEED | ID: 1021 | DSMZ Medium: 1021 (mediadive.medium:1021) | Aerobic: No\\n\\nSuperseded histori